","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahmoudelshaieb","id":45439239,"login":"mahmoudelshaieb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDM5MjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/commits/9b6780b859e85d54b9c4e7382de1d36ea09fdeb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:15:18Z","email":"elshaieb_career@outlook.com","name":"mahmoudelshaieb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:15:18Z","email":"elshaieb_career@outlook.com","name":"mahmoudelshaieb"},"message":"Ignore .gstack/\n\nAdded by the gstack browse tooling when it ran in this working copy, not\nby the case study refactor. Kept as its own commit so it can be dropped\nindependently.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f73f4302a90b98774a68a0d8497dcadb0803d3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/git/trees/8f73f4302a90b98774a68a0d8497dcadb0803d3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/git/commits/9b6780b859e85d54b9c4e7382de1d36ea09fdeb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45439239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahmoudelshaieb","id":45439239,"login":"mahmoudelshaieb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDM5MjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/commit/9b6780b859e85d54b9c4e7382de1d36ea09fdeb8","node_id":"C_kwDOFquSLtoAKDliNjc4MGI4NTllODVkNTRiOWM0ZTczODJkZTFkMzZlYTA5ZmRlYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/commit/5df17517cc449af99b51a0ff62f7a7865f54dfa0","sha":"5df17517cc449af99b51a0ff62f7a7865f54dfa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/commits/5df17517cc449af99b51a0ff62f7a7865f54dfa0"}],"sha":"9b6780b859e85d54b9c4e7382de1d36ea09fdeb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/commits/9b6780b859e85d54b9c4e7382de1d36ea09fdeb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45439239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahmoudelshaieb","id":45439239,"login":"mahmoudelshaieb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDM5MjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/commits/5df17517cc449af99b51a0ff62f7a7865f54dfa0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:15:13Z","email":"elshaieb_career@outlook.com","name":"mahmoudelshaieb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:15:13Z","email":"elshaieb_career@outlook.com","name":"mahmoudelshaieb"},"message":"Give each case study its own content module\n\nCase study content lived in one 802-line data.js as flat consts with\npositional keys (title01/desc01/img01 ... title14/desc14/img14). Two\nproblems followed from that:\n\n- Five consts (impactmetrics, DS, sakSuccess, sakLearning,\n  sakProjectStatus) were imported by both the CRM and Sales Tool pages,\n  so editing one study''s metrics or outro silently rewrote the other''s.\n- Adding a section cost a new top-level const, a destructuring line, and\n  an entry in the bottom export block, so per-section cost grew with the\n  number of sections.\n\nEach study now owns a module in src/constrains/cases/ exporting one\nobject (meta / overview / metrics / status / sections / outro). Repeated\nsections are arrays the layout maps over instead of numbered consts.\nNothing is shared between modules: where the Sales Tool genuinely repeats\nthe CRM''s design-system panel, the values are copied with a comment\nrather than aliased, so the duplication is visible and independently\neditable.\n\ncases/index.js is the registry, and caseLinks is derived from each\nmodule''s meta, so a work-index card can no longer drift from the study it\nlinks to. cases/status.js pins the exact strings WorkFlowStatus switches\non, which otherwise render no badge at all on a typo.\n\nTwo layout components (BentoCaseStudy, NarrativeCaseStudy) render the\nmodules; the page files drop to five lines each. No existing\npresentational component changed.\n\ndata.js keeps only site chrome (nav, about, contact, work-index intro)\nplus dormant coin*/sak* content; 47 orphaned consts removed.\n\n  data.js    802 -> 319 lines      ManageCRM  156 -> 6\n  main.js  91.67 -> 90.86 kB gzip  SalesTool  135 -> 6\n                                   DrivingApp  83 -> 6\n\nVerified inert: built the parent commit in a separate worktree, served\nboth builds, and diffed rendered DOM for /, both bento studies,\n/driving-app, /about and /contact. All six identical once\nreact-medium-image-zoom''s per-render random ids are normalized.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e59cc4fcb3c64d7ce5729c36b50dd1cfb7d4716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/git/trees/6e59cc4fcb3c64d7ce5729c36b50dd1cfb7d4716"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahmoudelshaieb/Personal-plan/git/commits/5df17517cc449af99b51a0ff62f7a7865f54dfa0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45439239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahmoudelshaieb","id":45439239,"login":"mahmoudelshaieb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDM5MjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahmoudelshaieb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahm