l","name":"Daan Debie"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:42:17.535Z","repositoryId":380505729,"sha":"607d238719521c53fcefb46cbc8383792783e1b7"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"DonDebonair","providerType":"User"},"email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-03T14:17:39Z","committedDate":"2026-08-03T14:17:39Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"DonDebonair","providerType":"User"},"email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:42:17.535Z","repositoryId":380505729,"sha":"56415dc310c61c9a30834d8e17694f2a791103ca"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:42:17.535Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/85d858be7473c9e5f499feb26e67312ad8b8214f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:40:29Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"fix: vercel.json was missing the routing settings the URL scheme depends on\n\nInvestigated whether @astrojs/vercel is needed. It is not: the adapter is only\nrequired for SSR or for Vercel-specific services (Web Analytics, Image Optimization).\nThis site is fully static and optimises images at build time, so routing them through\nVercel''s optimiser would re-process already-optimised WebP at request time and bill\nfor it. Vercel''s Astro preset builds and serves dist/ unaided.\n\nChecking that turned up a real gap:\n\n- trailingSlash was unset. Vercel''s default is undefined, which serves /about and\n  /about/ as two 200s with no redirect -- their docs call it \"not recommended because\n  it could lead to search engines indexing two different pages with duplicate\n  content\". Phase 0 recorded the opposite as an invariant: /writings/rss/ 308s to\n  /writings/rss. trailingSlash: false restores it.\n- cleanUrls was unset, and it is what makes build.format: ''file'' work. Per the docs it\n  is what serves about.html at /about and 308-redirects /about.html to /about. Without\n  it every page would have a second indexable URL at .html, and possibly no\n  extensionless URL at all. It only affects .html; feeds, sitemaps, robots.txt, fonts\n  and the download files are untouched.\n\nNeither is testable locally -- both are applied by Vercel''s edge, not a static file\nserver -- so the preview deploy has to confirm them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"438b3180e1158033b1dc669b2a3fc69cb4fa04ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/438b3180e1158033b1dc669b2a3fc69cb4fa04ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/85d858be7473c9e5f499feb26e67312ad8b8214f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/85d858be7473c9e5f499feb26e67312ad8b8214f","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDg1ZDg1OGJlNzQ3M2M5ZTVmNDk5ZmViMjZlNjczMTJhZDhiODIxNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/2611b91361988b3cd7230307e3149ddf2b960154","sha":"2611b91361988b3cd7230307e3149ddf2b960154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/2611b91361988b3cd7230307e3149ddf2b960154"}],"sha":"85d858be7473c9e5f499feb26e67312ad8b8214f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/85d858be7473c9e5f499feb26e67312ad8b8214f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/2611b91361988b3cd7230307e3149ddf2b960154/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:14:49Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"chore: phase 9 — cutover\n\nDeletes the Next.js application: pages/, components/, layouts/, lib/, styles/,\npatches/, next.config.js, next-sitemap.config.js, next-env.d.ts.\n\npackage.json pruned from 60 direct dependencies to 37. Twelve of the 29 runtime deps\nare the typographic-* plugins the plan explicitly kept, so the non-typography\nfootprint is 17.\n\nESLint removed. eslint-config-next was the entire configuration, and with no React,\nno JSX and no Next there is nothing left for it to check that astro check does not.\nThat took @typescript-eslint/*, eslint-plugin-react and eslint-config-prettier with\nit. lint-staged now runs Prettier only. eslint-plugin-astro with a flat config is the\nroute back if linting is wanted.\n\nspike/ becomes tools/. The directory had become a hazard: spike/shiki/*.json and\nspike/plugins/transformer-code-title.mjs were byte-identical duplicates of the live\nfiles in src/, so editing the wrong copy would have looked like it worked and changed\nnothing. Superseded artifacts deleted; the verification scripts are promoted to\ntools/, which is what they actually are.\n\nCLAUDE.md and README.md rewritten for the new stack. CLAUDE.md front-loads the traps\nthat cost time during the migration: the two underscore rules, the rehypeHeadingIds\nordering, the Shiki background rule, .article being a flex column, and\nAstro.url.pathname not being the canonical path.\n\nVerified: the pruned tree builds to 62 pages byte-identical to the pre-prune build\nonce the hashed CSS filename is normalised, so deleting the old app changed no output.\nastro check clean, content comparison unchanged, Prettier clean across the repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f476967af61bcb4c9bdefc26a356bef830c3fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/8f476967af61bcb4c9bdefc26a356bef830c3fb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/2611b91361988b3cd7230307e3149ddf2b960154","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/2611b91361988b3cd7230307e3149ddf2b960154","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDI2MTFiOTEzNjE5ODhiM2NkNzIzMDMwN2UzMTQ5ZGRmMmI5NjAxNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/9e4eabb1ee5ad973aba7772a60217638849269d9","sha":"9e4eabb1ee5ad973aba7772a60217638849269d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/9e4eabb1ee5ad973aba7772a60217638849269d9"}],"sha":"2611b91361988b3cd7230307e3149ddf2b960154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/2611b91361988b3cd7230307e3149ddf2b960154"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/9e4eabb1ee5ad973aba7772a60217638849269d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T11:43:11Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"docs: record the font-smoothing finding in the phase 8 report\n\nDocuments the fifth layout bug and how it slipped past phase 8: font smoothing\nchanges rendering without changing metrics, so every layout and height check passed\nwhile dark mode still looked wrong. The uniform sub-3% pixel difference on pages whose\nheights matched exactly was the signal, and it was dismissed as noise.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfb57f208bacc605068907510c99ab9cfa9519a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/cfb57f208bacc605068907510c99ab9cfa9519a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/9e4eabb1ee5ad973aba7772a60217638849269d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/9e4eabb1ee5ad973aba7772a60217638849269d9","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDllNGVhYmIxZWU1YWQ5NzNhYmE3NzcyYTYwMjE3NjM4ODQ5MjY5ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/40acbd4ed82fb0206ae72fb22e7b2816273c71a2","sha":"40acbd4ed82fb0206ae72fb22e7b2816273c71a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/40acbd4ed82fb0206ae72fb22e7b2816273c71a2"}],"sha":"9e4eabb1ee5ad973aba7772a60217638849269d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/9e4eabb1ee5ad973aba7772a60217638849269d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/40acbd4ed82fb0206ae72fb22e7b2816273c71a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T11:36:11Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"fix: restore Chakra''s font smoothing — dark mode was too high-contrast\n\nReported from the running site: text reads noticeably more contrasty than the\noriginal in dark mode.\n\nCause: Chakra''s CSSReset sets -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased and\n-moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale on html; Tailwind''s Preflight does not. On macOS\nthe browser default is subpixel antialiasing, which renders light-on-dark text\nheavier. The old site''s more subdued look was grayscale antialiasing all along.\n\nReconciled the whole Preflight/Chakra reset delta declaration by declaration rather\nthan by eye, which is what the phase 3 checklist item actually asked for. html also\ngained text-rendering: optimizeLegibility, -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100% and\ntouch-action: manipulation; body gained position: relative, min-height: 100%,\nfont-feature-settings: \"kern\" and the 200ms background-color transition Chakra used\nto animate the colour-mode toggle. Preflight''s universal selector already covered\nmargin: 0.\n\nThree pages are now pixel-identical to the baseline -- 0.00%, not one differing pixel\n-- in both modes, and the others dropped from 0.5-2.8% to 0.02-0.04%. Article pages\nimproved too (post-sidenote 6.3% -> 4.3%).\n\nPhase 8 had seen this as a uniform sub-3% difference on pages whose heights matched\nexactly, and dismissed it as antialiasing noise. It was antialiasing, but not noise:\nfont smoothing changes rendering without changing metrics, so every layout and height\ncheck passed while the site still looked wrong.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa2226f5eae22292a02b387dba1421250e3a2a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/fa2226f5eae22292a02b387dba1421250e3a2a20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/40acbd4ed82fb0206ae72fb22e7b2816273c71a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/40acbd4ed82fb0206ae72fb22e7b2816273c71a2","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDQwYWNiZDRlZDgyZmIwMjA2YWU3MmZiMjJlN2IyODE2MjczYzcxYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/6eea9dd2f9424ee3ffec945a4e6116db55f0ef05","sha":"6eea9dd2f9424ee3ffec945a4e6116db55f0ef05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/6eea9dd2f9424ee3ffec945a4e6116db55f0ef05"}],"sha":"40acbd4ed82fb0206ae72fb22e7b2816273c71a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/40acbd4ed82fb0206ae72fb22e7b2816273c71a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/6eea9dd2f9424ee3ffec945a4e6116db55f0ef05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:32:08Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"fix: phase 8 — verification, and four layout bugs it caught\n\nFull verification against ../baseline. All 61 pages, 6 generated files, 4 download\nlinks and 4 kept public images return 200. Sitemap byte-identical with the same 60\nURLs. Feeds: 9 items in all three formats, SideNote intact, no relative URLs left.\nHeading title-casing verified by id AND by text; all 10 acronyms preserved at\nidentical counts. Theme toggle and mobile menu verified on the built site.\n\nResult: HTML across five representative pages drops 69.2% (409KB -> 126KB), script\ntags per page go from 10-14 to 2 inline, and zero JavaScript files ship.\n\nThe screenshot diff caught four real layout bugs, none of which errored, appeared in\na content diff, or looked wrong in isolation:\n\n- Chakra''s <Heading> defaults to size=\"xl\", so <Heading fontSize=\"lg\"> keeps size xl''s\n  line-height (1.33/1.2) while overriding only the font size. I had used 1.2, and in\n  one place the body''s 1.5.\n- Flex items do not collapse margins, and the article body used to be a flex column.\n  As a plain block container every adjacent block boundary collapsed to max(mb, mt),\n  losing ~9px each -- about 800px over a long article, matching the observed drift.\n- A topic badge is a <span> inside an <a>, and the anchor is the flex item, inheriting\n  the 18px/1.5 line-height. Collapsing them into one element made every post entry\n  ~11px shorter.\n- Chakra <Text> is a <p> with 0.5rem margins; I had used bare <span>s for the footer\n  copyright and the article byline, each 1rem short in a flex container.\n\nAfter the fixes six of thirteen pages match the baseline height exactly, and article\npages land within 12-108px on lengths of 5,000-16,000px. Remaining pixel differences\non article pages are Shiki vs Prism token markup, accepted in phase 1B.\n\nAdds spike/tools/compare-screenshots.mjs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d346faea2c6394384e5363c17c0303341f442cb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/d346faea2c6394384e5363c17c0303341f442cb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/6eea9dd2f9424ee3ffec945a4e6116db55f0ef05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/6eea9dd2f9424ee3ffec945a4e6116db55f0ef05","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDZlZWE5ZGQyZjk0MjRlZTNmZmVjOTQ1YTRlNjExNmRiNTVmMGVmMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/e19378831884492327d1a4f98d3a42fa353fb7ec","sha":"e19378831884492327d1a4f98d3a42fa353fb7ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/e19378831884492327d1a4f98d3a42fa353fb7ec"}],"sha":"6eea9dd2f9424ee3ffec945a4e6116db55f0ef05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/6eea9dd2f9424ee3ffec945a4e6116db55f0ef05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/e19378831884492327d1a4f98d3a42fa353fb7ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T11:31:40Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"feat: phase 7 — feeds, sitemap, redirects\n\nThree real feed endpoints over a shared memoised builder, replacing the getStaticProps\nside effect that wrote into public/. The Container API renders the MDX per the phase 1A\ndecision; SideNote survives into the feed with zero raw component leaks and zero\nrelative URLs left. Sitemap matches the baseline URL set exactly, robots.txt is\nrestored, and vercel.json carries the /blog/:slug redirect as a 308.\n\nFixed two pre-existing bugs: feed titles were double-title-cased, so subscribers got\n\"Aws Iam Demystified\" while the site showed \"AWS IAM Demystified\"; and the Atom <icon>\npointed at /favicons/banner.png, which has never existed.\n\nFindings:\n\n- The sitemap was about to publish /_kitchensink. next-sitemap skipped\n  underscore-prefixed paths as internal, so the deliberately unlinked styling test page\n  was never listed. Astro has no such rule; an explicit filter restores it.\n- The old build ran two versions of `title` at once: remark-capitalize bundled\n  title@3.3.1 for headings while frontmatter used the root title@3.5.3. Consolidating\n  on 3.5.3 improved three headings (TypeScript, GitHub, PHP) and regressed three.\n  Two were recovered via TITLE_OPTIONS.special; \"Previously on…\" -> \"Previously On…\"\n  is accepted, since capitalising the final word is standard title case. All six keep\n  their ids, so no anchors break.\n- Heading ids were the wrong signal for catching that: slugs are lowercased, so every\n  casing change was invisible to the phase 4 comparison. It now compares heading text\n  keyed by id.\n- Feed dates move from local to UTC. parseISO resolved date-only strings to local\n  midnight, so pubDates shifted with the build machine''s timezone. Builds are now\n  timezone-independent and match what production already emitted.\n\nsitemap lastmod is dropped deliberately -- one identical meaningless timestamp across\nall 60 URLs, same reasoning as the /topics date in phase 6. changefreq and priority\nare preserved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98332a8ad964137db383f7c2c07bb142d9e82db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/98332a8ad964137db383f7c2c07bb142d9e82db0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/e19378831884492327d1a4f98d3a42fa353fb7ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/e19378831884492327d1a4f98d3a42fa353fb7ec","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKGUxOTM3ODgzMTg4NDQ5MjMyN2QxYTRmOThkM2E0MmZhMzUzZmI3ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/f55cedd110e420ee5ac466656ed50a9ecd6eec6b","sha":"f55cedd110e420ee5ac466656ed50a9ecd6eec6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/f55cedd110e420ee5ac466656ed50a9ecd6eec6b"}],"sha":"e19378831884492327d1a4f98d3a42fa353fb7ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/e19378831884492327d1a4f98d3a42fa353fb7ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/f55cedd110e420ee5ac466656ed50a9ecd6eec6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T08:02:27Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"refactor: normalize article title size onto the writings size\n\nThe Chakra original used Heading size=\"xl\" for /writings/[slug] and size=\"2xl\" for\n/archive/[slug], so archive titles rendered larger. Normalized onto xl on request;\nArticleLayout no longer takes a titleSize prop.\n\nVerified by computed style at the 18px root: all three article routes now report\n40.5px / 48.6px, where archive and _kitchensink previously reported 54px / 54px.\n\nThis is an intentional visual change on 24 pages -- 23 archive posts plus\n_kitchensink -- and is recorded as the third exception to the byte-identical ground\nrule. The content and heading-id comparison is unaffected.\n\n/ and /about keep size=\"2xl\" for their page titles; they are not article pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc3150918a66acfc7d060e615300865a6851a8d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/bc3150918a66acfc7d060e615300865a6851a8d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/f55cedd110e420ee5ac466656ed50a9ecd6eec6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/f55cedd110e420ee5ac466656ed50a9ecd6eec6b","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKGY1NWNlZGQxMTBlNDIwZWU1YWM0NjY2NTZlZDUwYTllY2Q2ZWVjNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/51586a4168f0c5e2e42595b19810b43e79092332","sha":"51586a4168f0c5e2e42595b19810b43e79092332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/51586a4168f0c5e2e42595b19810b43e79092332"}],"sha":"f55cedd110e420ee5ac466656ed50a9ecd6eec6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/f55cedd110e420ee5ac466656ed50a9ecd6eec6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/51586a4168f0c5e2e42595b19810b43e79092332/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T18:53:36Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"feat: phase 6 — routes\n\nAll 61 URLs emit, verified against ../baseline/meta/urls.txt by set comparison: none\nmissing, none extra. Plus a 404. Feed generation is gone from the home page; Phase 7\ngives it real endpoints.\n\nFindings:\n\n- build.format: ''file'' silently corrupted every canonical URL. Astro.url.pathname is\n  the emitted file path, so it reads /about.html at build time, and every page was\n  publishing a canonical and og:url that were not the URLs actually served. Caught by\n  diffing the whole meta block against the baseline rather than eyeballing pages.\n  Meta.astro now strips the extension and collapses /index.html to /. After the fix\n  every page''s metadata matches the baseline exactly, apart from the two intended\n  date removals.\n- /_kitchensink cannot be a page file. Astro excludes anything under src/pages whose\n  filename starts with _, silently and with no error. The exclusion applies to\n  filenames, not param values, so the URL is emitted from the root-level [topic]\n  catch-all instead.\n- The two article pages use different title sizes and that is not a typo: writings is\n  Chakra size=\"xl\", archive is size=\"2xl\". Verified by computed style, 40.5px vs 54px\n  at the 18px root.\n- Astro emits no 404 unless you write one. Next generated one automatically, wrapped\n  in the app layout, and the Phase 0 capture has it. Without src/pages/404.astro\n  Vercel would have served its own generic page.\n\nThe topics and topic pages no longer stamp new Date().toISOString() into\narticle:published_time, so builds are reproducible again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87b585a1695f83e8558e2d14e5d41666253d10e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/87b585a1695f83e8558e2d14e5d41666253d10e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/51586a4168f0c5e2e42595b19810b43e79092332","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/51586a4168f0c5e2e42595b19810b43e79092332","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDUxNTg2YTQxNjhmMGM1ZTJlNDI1OTViMTk4MTBiNDNlNzkwOTIzMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/04a6498404c7f6a162d54ad42ed3c46e6fba0b88","sha":"04a6498404c7f6a162d54ad42ed3c46e6fba0b88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/04a6498404c7f6a162d54ad42ed3c46e6fba0b88"}],"sha":"51586a4168f0c5e2e42595b19810b43e79092332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/51586a4168f0c5e2e42595b19810b43e79092332"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/04a6498404c7f6a162d54ad42ed3c46e6fba0b88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T18:16:01Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"feat: phase 5 — components\n\nEvery component ported to .astro with zero React. The two pieces of state Chakra\nmanaged -- the mobile menu and the colour mode -- are about fifteen lines of vanilla\nJS between them. Prose styling moves to src/styles/article.css as plain descendant\nselectors, replacing MDXComponents.tsx (123 lines) and the syntax-highlighting half\nof styles/styles.ts.\n\nVerified by screenshot at 1280px in both colour modes against ../baseline: column\nwidth, wrapping, badges, series box, SideNote, tables, task lists, code titles and\nline highlighting all line up. Body backgrounds confirmed rgb(255,255,255) and\nrgb(23,25,35).\n\nFindings:\n\n- Fixed a real bug in the 1B spike''s Shiki CSS. Its \"six lines\" snippet set\n  background-color on .astro-code span as well as .astro-code. --shiki-*-bg is set on\n  the <pre> and inherits, so every token span painted its own opaque rectangle over\n  the highlighted-line band, turning it into a row of dark boxes. Nearly invisible in\n  light mode, obvious in dark, which is how it survived the spike. Corrected here and\n  in spike/README.md.\n- Chakra''s breakpoints are not Tailwind''s, and sm is the one that matters: 30em vs\n  40rem. The NavBar collapses at sm, so Tailwind''s defaults would have moved the\n  layout switch by 160px on every phone. All breakpoints overridden to Chakra''s.\n- GFM emits column alignment as inline style=\"text-align:right\", not an align\n  attribute, so a faithful port of MDXComponents.tsx''s props.align branch would have\n  been dead code.\n- public/site.webmanifest has never been linked. The plan listed adding it, but the\n  baseline has no rel=\"manifest\", so adding it would be a change rather than a port.\n- Indented code blocks render as paragraphs in both stacks -- MDX disables them.\n  Confirmed against the baseline before assuming a regression.\n- Icon.astro holds thirteen icons, not the six the plan counted; it missed the four\n  social icons in the footer. Path data extracted verbatim from the packages it\n  replaces.\n\nAlso seeds both colour-mode storage keys in the capture script, so the phase 8 dark\nscreenshots cannot silently come out light.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ceafbfdb5b33261761d94e9a263f216f3ebebe73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/ceafbfdb5b33261761d94e9a263f216f3ebebe73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/04a6498404c7f6a162d54ad42ed3c46e6fba0b88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/04a6498404c7f6a162d54ad42ed3c46e6fba0b88","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDA0YTY0OTg0MDRjN2Y2YTE2MmQ1NGFkNDJlZDNjNDZlNmZiYTBiODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/912ecf628465496090a77d828ad75690a0c4cf4c","sha":"912ecf628465496090a77d828ad75690a0c4cf4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/912ecf628465496090a77d828ad75690a0c4cf4c"}],"sha":"04a6498404c7f6a162d54ad42ed3c46e6fba0b88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/04a6498404c7f6a162d54ad42ed3c46e6fba0b88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/912ecf628465496090a77d828ad75690a0c4cf4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T11:48:32Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"feat: phase 4 — content layer\n\nContent collections + Zod schemas, the in-repo remark-title-case plugin, the full\nremark-textr stack, Shiki with the two hand-ported themes, the five fence edits, and\n21 images moved to src/assets for build-time optimisation.\n\nVerified against the baseline: 31 of 33 documents have byte-identical heading ids and\nidentical typographic-character counts. Both exceptions are intended and recorded.\n\nNotable findings:\n\n- The rehypeHeadingIds gotcha. rehype-slug is replaced by Astro''s own slugger, but it\n  must be listed explicitly as the first rehype plugin; Astro otherwise injects it\n  after user plugins and rehype-autolink-headings silently emits no anchors.\n- The _kitchensink em-dash count drops from 79 to 2. With GFM off, table separator\n  rows were plain text and typographic-em-dashes converted every run of hyphens. With\n  GFM on the table parser consumes them first. Self-explaining confirmation that GFM\n  is doing what was intended.\n- remark-capitalize trimmed every text node inside a heading, including nested ones,\n  which deleted the spaces between them: one archive heading renders as \"Help!My\n  GirlfriendCan''t Choose...\". Fixed rather than reproduced. The trim compensated for\n  nothing -- title() preserves outer whitespace, so dropping it gives exactly what\n  title-casing the whole heading produces, without that approach''s fragile assumption\n  that title() preserves length. One heading and one anchor id change; nothing links\n  to the old id.\n- The image move needed more care than \"move all 20 targets\". banner.png is the OG\n  image, and two archive files are link targets rather than images -- moving any of\n  them would have broken silently. Astro does resolve reference-style image\n  definitions, which was the one form at risk.\n- butwhy.gif survives frame-for-frame: 87 frames in, 87 ANMF chunks out, 13.1MB to\n  2.4MB. The \"791 frames\" figure in the phase 1 notes was wrong.\n\nType-check is clean. The 13 untyped packages the old tree silenced with @ts-ignore now\nhave real ambient declarations; the remaining casts are unified/mdast version skew.\n\nsrc/pages/check/[collection]/[slug].astro is temporary verification scaffolding and\nmust be deleted in phase 6.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fea4cb71a953ed1c6410086fabe6a7973f39baaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/fea4cb71a953ed1c6410086fabe6a7973f39baaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/912ecf628465496090a77d828ad75690a0c4cf4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/912ecf628465496090a77d828ad75690a0c4cf4c","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDkxMmVjZjYyODQ2NTQ5NjA5MGE3N2Q4MjhhZDc1NjkwYTBjNGNmNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/d4b5e5491c09d28fe192f086c81f8201140a1fd4","sha":"d4b5e5491c09d28fe192f086c81f8201140a1fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/d4b5e5491c09d28fe192f086c81f8201140a1fd4"}],"sha":"912ecf628465496090a77d828ad75690a0c4cf4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/912ecf628465496090a77d828ad75690a0c4cf4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/d4b5e5491c09d28fe192f086c81f8201140a1fd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:51:31Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"feat: phase 3 — design system\n\nSemantic token layer in src/styles/global.css: 40 roles covering every colour\ndecision in the Chakra source, declared in :root and flipped once in .dark, exposed\nto Tailwind via @theme inline. Plus the font stacks, Chakra''s font scale, the 18px\nroot, and a blocking colour-mode script.\n\nColour mode follows the system preference: OS preference is the default, a manual\ntoggle overrides and persists, OS changes are followed live only while no override\nis stored. The script reads Chakra''s old chakra-ui-color-mode key as a fallback so\nexisting visitors keep their choice.\n\nTwo findings worth recording:\n\n- The baseline HTML cannot be used as the colour source of truth. Every\n  useColorModeValue resolves at render time, so the static HTML bakes in the light\n  branch and the dark rules beside it are Chakra''s computed variants, not the\n  author''s dark choice. Caught on inline code, which asks for gray/pink but emits\n  gray for both modes. Values were taken from the source instead; the Phase 0\n  screenshots remain authoritative since they came from a hydrated browser.\n- The MDX <hr> and the footer Divider are the same colour in light mode and\n  different in dark (gray.600 vs whiteAlpha.300), so they need separate tokens.\n\ngreen.333 resolved to green.200, following the other three SideNote variants whose\ndark border equals their light background. This is an intentional dark-mode change:\nthe invalid value currently falls back to currentColor.\n\nTailwind''s default palette and font-size namespace are both cleared rather than\nextended — its gray-800 is not Chakra''s gray.800, and its sizes carry line-heights\nthat Chakra''s fontSize does not.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d6a7c861da97f86e5084f8582551356d1945bfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/9d6a7c861da97f86e5084f8582551356d1945bfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/d4b5e5491c09d28fe192f086c81f8201140a1fd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/d4b5e5491c09d28fe192f086c81f8201140a1fd4","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKGQ0YjVlNTQ5MWMwOWQyOGZlMTkyZjA4NmM4MWY4MjAxMTQwYTFmZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/7fd2e5e87db1897351a6f55d60f62b5f12b2fd7a","sha":"7fd2e5e87db1897351a6f55d60f62b5f12b2fd7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/7fd2e5e87db1897351a6f55d60f62b5f12b2fd7a"}],"sha":"d4b5e5491c09d28fe192f086c81f8201140a1fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/d4b5e5491c09d28fe192f086c81f8201140a1fd4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/7fd2e5e87db1897351a6f55d60f62b5f12b2fd7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:33:47Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"feat: phase 2 — Astro scaffold\n\nAstro 7.1.6 + @astrojs/mdx + @astrojs/sitemap + Tailwind 4 via @tailwindcss/vite,\nscaffolded into the existing repo. content/ moves to src/content/ (git mv, history\npreserved); public/ stays put. The Next app remains on disk as the porting reference\nfor phases 3-7 and is deleted in phase 9 — but its build is dead from here, since\nmoving content/ breaks lib/posts.ts, so the next scripts are gone.\n\nThree findings recorded in MIGRATION.md:\n\n- Astro 7 made the Markdown engine pluggable. markdown.gfm/.smartypants/.remarkPlugins/\n  .rehypePlugins are deprecated and move onto markdown.processor: unified({...}).\n  shikiConfig is unaffected, so the 1B spike''s themes still drop in unchanged.\n- @astrojs/sitemap emits sitemap-index.xml, but the baseline serves sitemap.xml —\n  /sitemap.xml would 404. Phase 7 has to resolve it.\n- Stale gitignored feeds/sitemap/robots were sitting in public/ from the last Next\n  build and were being copied into dist/, which would have given phase 7 a false pass.\n  Deleted; the only copies are in ../baseline/.\n\nAlso: \"type\": \"module\" (eslintrc -> .cjs, prettierrc -> .mjs), prettier 2 -> 3 with\nprettier-plugin-astro, @types/node 18 -> 24 (vite 8 peer), typescript pinned to ^5\n(@astrojs/check does not accept 7), patch-package and the postinstall hook removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"001117ae20535b91c6bef8c55f93cd328c898228","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/001117ae20535b91c6bef8c55f93cd328c898228"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/7fd2e5e87db1897351a6f55d60f62b5f12b2fd7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/7fd2e5e87db1897351a6f55d60f62b5f12b2fd7a","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDdmZDJlNWU4N2RiMTg5NzM1MWE2ZjU1ZDYwZjYyYjVmMTJiMmZkN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/919944b9f10f0bc59be92f839d57e266735f8cb0","sha":"919944b9f10f0bc59be92f839d57e266735f8cb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/919944b9f10f0bc59be92f839d57e266735f8cb0"}],"sha":"7fd2e5e87db1897351a6f55d60f62b5f12b2fd7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/7fd2e5e87db1897351a6f55d60f62b5f12b2fd7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/919944b9f10f0bc59be92f839d57e266735f8cb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T19:45:20Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"chore: capture context that only lived in the conversation\n\nTwo things were about to be lost that the remaining phases need.\n\nChakra colour values: the plan listed the 26 token names but not their hex\nvalues, with extraction left as a Phase 3 TODO. That extraction needs\n@chakra-ui/react in node_modules, which the cutover uninstalls — so it would\nhave become painful to recover exactly when it is needed. Table added to\nPhase 3.\n\nVerification tooling: the screenshot capture script lived only in a\nsession-scoped scratchpad, and baseline/README.md admitted as much. Phase 8''s\nscreenshot diff is only meaningful if both sides are captured identically, and\nthe script encodes non-obvious workarounds (lazy-image forcing, the\nIntersectionObserver-at-60fps problem, font settling, dark-mode seeding).\nMoved to spike/tools/ along with the feed comparator and the GFM scanner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16d0c06d6b5aa3bb3b5a9ea0f17b58f56fbff469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/16d0c06d6b5aa3bb3b5a9ea0f17b58f56fbff469"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/919944b9f10f0bc59be92f839d57e266735f8cb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/919944b9f10f0bc59be92f839d57e266735f8cb0","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDkxOTk0NGI5ZjEwZjBiYzU5YmU5MmY4MzlkNTdlMjY2NzM1ZjhjYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/16a2918bba9b4278830ec054ca6b8fb61bcc6055","sha":"16a2918bba9b4278830ec054ca6b8fb61bcc6055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/16a2918bba9b4278830ec054ca6b8fb61bcc6055"}],"sha":"919944b9f10f0bc59be92f839d57e266735f8cb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/919944b9f10f0bc59be92f839d57e266735f8cb0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/16a2918bba9b4278830ec054ca6b8fb61bcc6055/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T19:37:17Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"docs: settle the GFM and image decisions\n\nGFM: ON. remark-gfm has never been in this project, so the kitchen sink''s\nTables/Task lists/Footnotes sections have never rendered, and the table\nmappings in MDXComponents have been dead since the first commit. Turning it\noff would preserve a bug and leave Phase 5 unable to style or test tables.\nVerified blast radius is _kitchensink plus two autolinked URLs in archive\nposts; the local hostname one gets backticked.\n\nImages: all 20 MDX image targets move to src/assets. Leaving them in public/\nis a regression, not the status quo — the current site optimises at request\ntime via /_next/image, which Astro''s public/ does not replace. Measured\nsavings 67-85%, and the 791-frame animated GIF converts to animated WebP\nrather than a flattened frame. The 4 archive-assets/files download links stay\nin public/ with unchanged URLs.\n\nAlso noted: 48.3 MB in archive-assets/files is referenced by nothing in\ncontent/ (sf2hadoop.jar alone is 44.7 MB). Separate decision, not migration\nscope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20eeff90289c273c2414778cf21e8c9cd7356964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/20eeff90289c273c2414778cf21e8c9cd7356964"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/16a2918bba9b4278830ec054ca6b8fb61bcc6055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/16a2918bba9b4278830ec054ca6b8fb61bcc6055","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDE2YTI5MThiYmE5YjQyNzg4MzBlYzA1NGNhNmI4ZmI2MWJjYzYwNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/13b3f5d55f62826d017b5ec40bd7d615c1650e43","sha":"13b3f5d55f62826d017b5ec40bd7d615c1650e43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/13b3f5d55f62826d017b5ec40bd7d615c1650e43"}],"sha":"16a2918bba9b4278830ec054ca6b8fb61bcc6055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/16a2918bba9b4278830ec054ca6b8fb61bcc6055"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/13b3f5d55f62826d017b5ec40bd7d615c1650e43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:31:03Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"chore: commit phase 1 spike artifacts\n\nMove the proven spike output into the repo so it is versioned rather than\nliving in a scratch directory. Re-deriving the Shiki scope mappings is the\ntedious part and it has already been done once correctly.\n\n- shiki/*.json      two hand-ported themes (Prism default / Night Owl + pink)\n- plugins/          transformer replacing rehype-code-titles\n- feeds/            Container API feed endpoint\n- astro.config.mjs  the easy-to-miss settings: gfm/smartypants off,\n                    apacheconf langAlias, defaultColor:false\n- screenshots/      cropped light+dark reference shots for Phase 8\n\nFull-page screenshots (4.6 MB each) left out; the crops carry the signal and\nthey are regenerable. MIGRATION.md now points at spike/ instead of an\nout-of-repo path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3c0eb418510bf1a379636d121c742025f29294c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/a3c0eb418510bf1a379636d121c742025f29294c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/13b3f5d55f62826d017b5ec40bd7d615c1650e43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/13b3f5d55f62826d017b5ec40bd7d615c1650e43","node_id":"C_kwDOFq4OgdoAKDEzYjNmNWQ1NWY2MjgyNmQwMTdiNWVjNDBiZDdkNjE1YzE2NTBlNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commit/0e26106301d46f0b8637856d3e1ae0702d54133f","sha":"0e26106301d46f0b8637856d3e1ae0702d54133f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/0e26106301d46f0b8637856d3e1ae0702d54133f"}],"sha":"13b3f5d55f62826d017b5ec40bd7d615c1650e43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/13b3f5d55f62826d017b5ec40bd7d615c1650e43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/commits/0e26106301d46f0b8637856d3e1ae0702d54133f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:25:12Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:45:06Z","email":"daan@dv.email","name":"Daan Debie"},"message":"chore: phase 1 spikes done\n\nBoth Phase 1 de-risk spikes pass; neither fallback is needed.\n\n1A — feeds: the Container API renders content-collection entries including\ncustom components (SideNote, Asterisk, Small) with props and slotted children\nintact, and the `feed` package emits all three formats. Verified against the\nPhase 0 baseline. Requires registering the MDX renderer manually via\naddServerRenderer, and pinning astro (experimental API).\n\n1B — syntax highlighting: two custom Shiki themes reproduce the Prism-default\nlight and Night-Owl-plus-pink dark palettes. Dual-theme mode with\ndefaultColor:false collapses ~150 lines of paired mode() CSS to six.\n\nFindings recorded in the plan:\n- feed titles are double-title-cased today, destroying acronyms (feeds.tsx:54)\n- Astro''s default smartypants conflicts with the remark-textr stack\n- apacheconf is not a Shiki language; needs langAlias to apache\n- Prism/TextMate scope divergence painted every function parameter orange\n- fence syntax: edit the 5 fences rather than maintain a parser plugin;\n  verified byte-identical output\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da69fdcfeac2e5031238d6a4ed883de3e7d91af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/trees/da69fdcfeac2e5031238d6a4ed883de3e7d91af7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DonDebonair/daan.fyi/git/commits/0e26106301d46f0b8637856d3e1ae0702d54133f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/854991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DonDebonair","id":854991,"login":"DonDebonair","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDk5MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonDebonair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonD