he\nBtcRateService dev URL. Preserves legacy endpoint contract.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"95e97f36322fc5a4407ebe01fa25bf07554ca52a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/trees/95e97f36322fc5a4407ebe01fa25bf07554ca52a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/commits/55617618fdec9062342722d7dcb68d6962dae230","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/55617618fdec9062342722d7dcb68d6962dae230","node_id":"C_kwDOFsiuC9oAKDU1NjE3NjE4ZmRlYzkwNjIzNDI3MjJkN2RjYjY4ZDY5NjJkYWUyMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/d8286ba994ae0e3b87bc447a4283c31350bece6e","sha":"d8286ba994ae0e3b87bc447a4283c31350bece6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/d8286ba994ae0e3b87bc447a4283c31350bece6e"}],"sha":"55617618fdec9062342722d7dcb68d6962dae230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/55617618fdec9062342722d7dcb68d6962dae230"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/d8286ba994ae0e3b87bc447a4283c31350bece6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:38:59Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:38:59Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"message":"feat(demo): add Module Federation host consuming portfolio remote\n\nPhase 5 of the rebuild. Scaffolds the demo host as a standalone, zoneless\nAngular 21 app and wires it as a Native Federation dynamic host\n(init --type=dynamic-host --port=4200).\n\n- app.routes lazy-loads the remote via loadRemoteModule({ remoteName:''portfolio'',\n  exposedModule:''./Routes'' }) at path '''' (topology preserved), with a fallback\n  route (star-fallback) shown when the remote is unavailable (e.g. Storybook)\n- public/federation.manifest.json points at the portfolio remote (dev :4201)\n- App shell rebuilt on @star/ui app-template: rates table, loading get-rate\n  button, and alerts filtered by severity; rates/loading held as signals and the\n  message log read as messageService.logs() for zoneless reactivity\n- app.config provides zoneless CD, HttpClient, router, and\n  { provide: IMessageService, useExisting: MessageService }\n- 5 unit tests (host + fallback) pass; lint clean; production build green\n- verified at runtime: nx serve portfolio + demo -> remoteEntry.json (exposes\n  ./Routes) and host index.html both served (HTTP 200)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc2fd181dbc9b2b31d12612e1e9dd404e947d032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/trees/bc2fd181dbc9b2b31d12612e1e9dd404e947d032"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/commits/d8286ba994ae0e3b87bc447a4283c31350bece6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/d8286ba994ae0e3b87bc447a4283c31350bece6e","node_id":"C_kwDOFsiuC9oAKGQ4Mjg2YmE5OTRhZTBlM2I4N2JjNDQ3YTQyODNjMzEzNTBiZWNlNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/594f955f88112f5dd16088199f8a77dac586e51c","sha":"594f955f88112f5dd16088199f8a77dac586e51c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/594f955f88112f5dd16088199f8a77dac586e51c"}],"sha":"d8286ba994ae0e3b87bc447a4283c31350bece6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/d8286ba994ae0e3b87bc447a4283c31350bece6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/594f955f88112f5dd16088199f8a77dac586e51c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:38:48Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:38:48Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"message":"refactor(shared): expose MessageService.logs as a signal\n\nZoneless, OnPush consumers (the demo host) need reactive log state. Replace the\nplain immutable LogItem[] with a signal exposed as a read-only Signal<LogItem[]>;\nIMessageService.logs becomes Signal<LogItem[]>. Specs and the BtcRateService test\nstub updated to read logs() and update via the signal.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7de4c84b145517cd54103f7fc7729c9d9586187a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/trees/7de4c84b145517cd54103f7fc7729c9d9586187a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/commits/594f955f88112f5dd16088199f8a77dac586e51c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/594f955f88112f5dd16088199f8a77dac586e51c","node_id":"C_kwDOFsiuC9oAKDU5NGY5NTVmODgxMTJmNWRkMTYwODgxOTlmOGE3N2RhYzU4NmU1MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/440569273a2363a42fb41f60ad244f1a0b4ff0b5","sha":"440569273a2363a42fb41f60ad244f1a0b4ff0b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/440569273a2363a42fb41f60ad244f1a0b4ff0b5"}],"sha":"594f955f88112f5dd16088199f8a77dac586e51c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/594f955f88112f5dd16088199f8a77dac586e51c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/440569273a2363a42fb41f60ad244f1a0b4ff0b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:30:13Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:30:13Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"message":"feat(portfolio): add Module Federation remote via Native Federation\n\nPhase 4 of the rebuild. Scaffolds the portfolio remote as a standalone,\nzoneless Angular 21 app on the esbuild application builder and initialises\nModule Federation with @angular-architects/native-federation (init --type=remote\n--port=4201).\n\nNative Federation is the newest Nx-endorsed Angular MF method: @nx/angular:host/\nremote (webpack withModuleFederation) is deprecated in Nx 23 and removed in v24,\nand the new @nx/react:consumer/provider generators are React-only. ADR-0003 and\nplan.md updated to record the pivot.\n\n- exposes ./Routes (entry.routes.ts) -> star-portfolio-entry component\n- Entry renders the preserved PORTFOLIO paper card + balances table using @star/ui\n- root shell keeps the legacy \"portfolio MicroApp Wrapper\" header + router-outlet\n- build emits remoteEntry.json (name: portfolio, exposes: ./Routes); @star/ui and\n  @star/shared/types are shared singletons\n- 3 unit tests pass; lint clean; production build green\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2bcd382f6c6aee6d5a0cb84f46c79c847b9d8aba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/trees/2bcd382f6c6aee6d5a0cb84f46c79c847b9d8aba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/commits/440569273a2363a42fb41f60ad244f1a0b4ff0b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/440569273a2363a42fb41f60ad244f1a0b4ff0b5","node_id":"C_kwDOFsiuC9oAKDQ0MDU2OTI3M2EyMzYzYTQyZmI0MWY2MGFkMjQ0ZjFhMGI0ZmYwYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/dd5fbd97cdbe2867e720d366521c43cca10cc55f","sha":"dd5fbd97cdbe2867e720d366521c43cca10cc55f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/dd5fbd97cdbe2867e720d366521c43cca10cc55f"}],"sha":"440569273a2363a42fb41f60ad244f1a0b4ff0b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/440569273a2363a42fb41f60ad244f1a0b4ff0b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/dd5fbd97cdbe2867e720d366521c43cca10cc55f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:18:52Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:18:52Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"message":"feat(ui): rebuild component library on standalone Angular 21 with signals\n\nPhase 3 of the rebuild. Recreates the @star/ui catalog as standalone,\nOnPush components with signal inputs and the new control flow, preserving the\nexisting selectors, HTML structure and SCSS design tokens (#e87e00, #001329,\n#002042, spin animation, atomic layout).\n\nComponents: primary-button, loading-button, icon, paper, alert, rates-table,\napp-template; plus the bySeverity pipe. All @Input() -> input(), *ngIf/*ngFor\n-> @if/@for, methods -> computed() where reactive.\n\n- selectors kept as star-* (eslint prefix set to \"star\")\n- app-template SCSS: darken() -> sass:color.adjust() (identical output, no\n  deprecation warnings)\n- 20 unit tests (parity+), lint clean\n- Storybook stories deferred to Phase 7 (framework installed there)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"14f6e193b0d13eb8c743a30651421f06ca5dfbf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/trees/14f6e193b0d13eb8c743a30651421f06ca5dfbf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/commits/dd5fbd97cdbe2867e720d366521c43cca10cc55f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/dd5fbd97cdbe2867e720d366521c43cca10cc55f","node_id":"C_kwDOFsiuC9oAKGRkNWZiZDk3Y2RiZTI4NjdlNzIwZDM2NjUyMWM0M2NjYTEwY2M1NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-star/nx-reference/commit/e95fc111738c15b18f89537aad7fcc79f5a92858","sha":"e95fc111738c15b18f89537aad7fcc79f5a92858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/e95fc111738c15b18f89537aad7fcc79f5a92858"}],"sha":"dd5fbd97cdbe2867e720d366521c43cca10cc55f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/dd5fbd97cdbe2867e720d366521c43cca10cc55f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/commits/e95fc111738c15b18f89537aad7fcc79f5a92858/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:11:51Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:11:51Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"message":"feat: rebuild shared libraries on Angular 21 (types, btc, services, data-access)\n\nPhase 2 of the rebuild. Recreates the leaf libraries with modern Angular idioms\nper ADR-0006, preserving public contracts and behaviour.\n\n- @star/shared/types: Rate, BtcResponse, Severity, LogItem, IMessageService token\n- @star/btc: btc() random rate (pure @nx/js lib)\n- @star/shared/services: MessageService (immutable log array for pure pipes)\n- @star/shared/data-access: BtcRateService via inject(); 1s delay, error logging,\n  dual dev/prod URL preserved\n- unit tests ported/expanded (10 tests, all green); lint clean\n- docs: amend ADR-0006 to adopt zoneless change detection (Angular 21 / Nx 23\n  scaffolded default; zone.js not installed)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"56bdb39875fa95a4c038550ad6bd5d2945c9814c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/trees/56bdb39875fa95a4c038550ad6bd5d2945c9814c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/commits/e95fc111738c15b18f89537aad7fcc79f5a92858","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562,"login":"mdvanes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTM1NjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use