unt":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T08:03:52Z","email":"4253562+mdvanes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mdvanes"},"message":"chore: rebuild workspace on Nx 23 with @nx/angular and module federation\n\nPhase 1 (foundation) of the from-scratch rebuild (ADR-0001). Replaces the legacy\nNx 13 / Angular 12 workspace with a fresh Nx 23.0.1 integrated monorepo and adds\nthe @nx/angular plugin (which brings @nx/module-federation and @nx/rspack).\n\n- remove legacy workspace (angular.json, nx.json, apps/, libs/, .storybook/,\n  jest presets, tsconfig.base.json, decorate-angular-cli, compodoc, tools/)\n- scaffold Nx 23 integrated monorepo (yarn 1 pinned via .yarn/releases)\n- add @nx/angular 23 (Angular ~21.2.0 toolchain, TypeScript 5.9)\n- add .prettierrc/.prettierignore; preserve docs/, .github/, .vstack/, README\n- amend ADR-0002: Angular tracks 21.2 (latest Nx 23-supported) not 22.0.5, since\n  Nx-native MF generators and executors are built against Angular 21.2\n\nPreserved audit trail and agent tooling remain intact; app/lib source is rebuilt\nin later phases from the design baseline in docs/.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f46bafebb3401f52340a4100e4be77b142dc08d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/trees/f46bafebb3401f52340a4100e4be77b142dc08d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-star/nx-reference/git/commits/f78d5917a7b55249b6eea304e2749aa6cccafd74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4253562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdvanes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mdvanes","id":4253562