/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand","id":25207394,"login":"kewinMarchand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA3Mzk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/0d083be57043538f715333262aa2d526b8af8619/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:44:00Z","email":"kewin.marchand@gmail.com","name":"kewin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T13:44:00Z","email":"kewin.marchand@gmail.com","name":"kewin"},"message":"Repositionne le profil sur l''axe accessibilité et qualité web\n\nL''en-tête nomme désormais le métier visé en premier, et le critère de\ntélétravail est celui qui s''applique réellement.\n\nChiffres alignés sur les mesures du 28/08/2026 :\n- projets clients ~40 → ~50 (51 mesurés sur l''historique git)\n- revues de code « ~1 000 » → « 950+ » : 983 s''arrondit vers le bas\n- React « depuis 2018 » → 2019, date du premier fichier mesurée\n- design system : pratique continue depuis huit ans\n- accessibilité : sans interruption depuis 2019, antériorité AFPA 2017\n- conduite en parallèle : 27 projets sur 2025, 81 fusions en 2024\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb4840059302cca6ad18dd28cef5942717bae157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/trees/cb4840059302cca6ad18dd28cef5942717bae157"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/commits/0d083be57043538f715333262aa2d526b8af8619","verificat