ostal\n  retiré — le fichier est indexable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"004ae694d1200d00ce8d80a15fb34efcbe063e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/trees/004ae694d1200d00ce8d80a15fb34efcbe063e05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/commits/3af99a0012f4d7a25353ff381576301e29930597","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25207394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand","id":25207394,"login":"kewinMarchand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA3Mzk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commit/3af99a0012f4d7a25353ff381576301e29930597","node_id":"C_kwDOFwWMVNoAKDNhZjk5YTAwMTJmNGQ3YTI1MzUzZmYzODE1NzYzMDFlMjk5MzA1OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commit/585be25e2ec2aeab71f7f769cd571153072c5a9d","sha":"585be25e2ec2aeab71f7f769cd571153072c5a9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/585be25e2ec2aeab71f7f769cd571153072c5a9d"}],"sha":"3af99a0012f4d7a25353ff381576301e29930597","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/3af99a0012f4d7a25353ff381576301e29930597"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25207394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand","id":25207394,"login":"kewinMarchand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA3Mzk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/585be25e2ec2aeab71f7f769cd571153072c5a9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:41:17Z","email":"k.marchand@purjus.fr","name":"kewin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:41:17Z","email":"k.marchand@purjus.fr","name":"kewin"},"message":"README : rétablit référent front-end, auteur principal, heures dispensées\n\nTrois formulations avaient été prudemment retirées sur la base d''un\ndécompte de commits. Vérification faite, elles sont exactes.\n\n- Auteur principal : le décompte de commits (22 %) sous-estimait la\n  contribution, la refonte ayant été livrée en un seul commit de\n  +133 761 lignes sur 2 786 fichiers après plusieurs mois de stash. Sur\n  les fichiers source, hors lockfiles et générés, la part réelle est de\n  60,4 % contre 4,8 % pour le contributeur suivant.\n- Référent front-end : rôle réel, confié oralement, sans formalisation\n  au contrat. Étayé par près d''un millier de revues de code.\n- Formation AFPA : seul formateur de la session, donc l''intégralité des\n  heures dispensées.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"657719d85a8a7ff900f11026a14cd6dd711e59ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/trees/657719d85a8a7ff900f11026a14cd6dd711e59ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/commits/585be25e2ec2aeab71f7f769cd571153072c5a9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25207394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand","id":25207394,"login":"kewinMarchand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA3Mzk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commit/585be25e2ec2aeab71f7f769cd571153072c5a9d","node_id":"C_kwDOFwWMVNoAKDU4NWJlMjVlMmVjMmFlYWI3MWY3Zjc2OWNkNTcxMTUzMDcyYzVhOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commit/3b4c34562d93f2df9c1ea0c5bdefae406042b7d7","sha":"3b4c34562d93f2df9c1ea0c5bdefae406042b7d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/3b4c34562d93f2df9c1ea0c5bdefae406042b7d7"}],"sha":"585be25e2ec2aeab71f7f769cd571153072c5a9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/585be25e2ec2aeab71f7f769cd571153072c5a9d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25207394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand","id":25207394,"login":"kewinMarchand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA3Mzk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/3b4c34562d93f2df9c1ea0c5bdefae406042b7d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:38:07Z","email":"k.marchand@purjus.fr","name":"kewin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:38:07Z","email":"k.marchand@purjus.fr","name":"kewin"},"message":"README : chiffres en ordres de grandeur plutôt qu''en valeurs exactes\n\nLes compteurs continuent d''évoluer jusqu''au départ : une valeur exacte\ndevient fausse en un mois. Les figures volatiles passent en ordres de\ngrandeur, les valeurs fixes (106 critères du RGAA, textes de loi, dates,\nvolume horaire de la formation AFPA) restent exactes.\n\n- une quarantaine de composants · près d''un millier de revues · une\n  trentaine de développeurs · une trentaine d''ADR · une soixantaine de\n  documents · plus de 250 scénarios · près de 150 définitions de pas ·\n  une douzaine de modules · près de 1 500 tickets · une trentaine de\n  comptes · une vingtaine de domaines\n- premier contributeur du dépôt, sans le décompte de commits\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fd24f621f1f5d0d5bbf9f4f7970882a947f1120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/trees/2fd24f621f1f5d0d5bbf9f4f7970882a947f1120"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/commits/3b4c34562d93f2df9c1ea0c5bdefae406042b7d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25207394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand","id":25207394,"login":"kewinMarchand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA3Mzk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commit/3b4c34562d93f2df9c1ea0c5bdefae406042b7d7","node_id":"C_kwDOFwWMVNoAKDNiNGMzNDU2MmQ5M2YyZGY5YzFlYTBjNWJkZWZhZTQwNjA0MmI3ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commit/f52d6d78586692411411b33f86358a6d7b6904cd","sha":"f52d6d78586692411411b33f86358a6d7b6904cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/f52d6d78586692411411b33f86358a6d7b6904cd"}],"sha":"3b4c34562d93f2df9c1ea0c5bdefae406042b7d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/3b4c34562d93f2df9c1ea0c5bdefae406042b7d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25207394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand","id":25207394,"login":"kewinMarchand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA3Mzk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/f52d6d78586692411411b33f86358a6d7b6904cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:36:15Z","email":"k.marchand@purjus.fr","name":"kewin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:36:15Z","email":"k.marchand@purjus.fr","name":"kewin"},"message":"README : alignement sur le CV, permis B, section IA\n\n- En-tête et résumé alignés sur le label et le summary du CV\n- Compétences : les cinq groupes du CV (langages, frameworks, architecture\n  & qualité, outils & back-end, méthodes) en tête de section\n- Nouvelle section « Développement assisté par IA » : contexte projet\n  versionné, agents dédiés, skills et commandes, hooks de contrôle\n- Parcours détaillé selon le CV : 9 expériences avec leurs dates réelles,\n  dont Botanic et les employeurs paysagistes distingués\n- Formation : les 6 entrées du CV, modules du titre Designer web précisés\n- Nouvelle section Distinctions : prix de l''apprentissage Midi-Pyrénées 2005\n- Langues alignées : espagnol intermédiaire, anglais sans conversation\n- Section Divers : permis B et botanique, comme le CV\n- Retiré : « Lecture » des centres d''intérêt, et la phrase de commentaire\n  sur les compétences absentes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a087bf1d475d105fe2459d501058d0666bbf5da8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/trees/a087bf1d475d105fe2459d501058d0666bbf5da8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/commits/f52d6d78586692411411b33f86358a6d7b6904cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25207394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand","id":25207394,"login":"kewinMarchand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA3Mzk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commit/f52d6d78586692411411b33f86358a6d7b6904cd","node_id":"C_kwDOFwWMVNoAKGY1MmQ2ZDc4NTg2NjkyNDExNDExYjMzZjg2MzU4YTZkN2I2OTA0Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commit/a23f1473351b20ce39292fc7a55f1392f8a3cfa7","sha":"a23f1473351b20ce39292fc7a55f1392f8a3cfa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/a23f1473351b20ce39292fc7a55f1392f8a3cfa7"}],"sha":"f52d6d78586692411411b33f86358a6d7b6904cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/f52d6d78586692411411b33f86358a6d7b6904cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25207394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kewinMarchand","id":25207394,"login":"kewinMarchand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjA3Mzk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/commits/a23f1473351b20ce39292fc7a55f1392f8a3cfa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:22:27Z","email":"k.marchand@purjus.fr","name":"kewin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:22:27Z","email":"k.marchand@purjus.fr","name":"kewin"},"message":"README : parcours complet, compétences mesurées, réalisations exhaustives\n\nRepositionnement sur l''accessibilité numérique et la qualité web.\n\n- Compétences réécrites sur la pratique réelle mesurée (983 revues de code,\n  31 ADR, 41 composants, 261 scénarios e2e, 4 audits RGAA) au lieu des\n  niveaux en emoji, avec une section « ce que je ne fais pas »\n- Réalisations regroupées par nature de projet et complétées : refonte RRG,\n  plateformes B2B Djust, DHL Express, Oreca, Alpine, RRG RH, Datagora,\n  Montaclair, et une section dédiée aux audits d''accessibilité\n- Parcours complet, paysagisme inclus, avec l''infographie paysagère comme\n  charnière de la reconversion\n- Formation : niveau 5 européen précisé, BEPA/Bac pro/BTSA détaillés,\n  autoformation continue ajoutée\n- Anglais : mention explicite de la limite orale\n- Image socialify de fin supprimée\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2b80286f654bf39365fedada09c5c377343e9be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/trees/d2b80286f654bf39365fedada09c5c377343e9be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kewinMarchand/kewinMarchand/git/commits/a23f1473351b20ce39292fc7a55f1392f8a3cfa7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25207394?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kewinMarchand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http